    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "the bells won't stop ringing... it's everywhere. they're at the gates. i just look out the window and i don't even feel scared anymore, i just feel... done. everything we built, everything we tried to save, it's just going to be ash by morning. feels like there's no point in even trying to hide or run anymore. what's the point of fighting something that's already won?",
