      "content": "it's not just the noise though. it's the feeling that it would be so much cleaner if it just happened now. instead of waiting for the fire or the screaming or whatever comes through those gates. is there even a way to face this with any kind of honor, or are we just meant to wait around and be terrified until it happens?",
